        "original_id": "c1234c84-b62f-59fd-b1bc-2a0596cf6e9f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Epic Poker League, Federated Sports + Gaming, World Series of Poker, European Poker Tour\n- People: Jeffrey Pollack, Annie Duke, Matt Savage, Michael McDonald, Vanessa Selbst, Barbara Freer\n- Roles: Executive Chairman, Commissioner, Tournament Director\n- Events: 2011 Epic Poker League tournaments, 2004 WSOP gold bracelet, 1979 WSOP Ladies Limit 7 Card Stud event\n\nFacts:\n- Barbara Freer won the 1979 World Series of Poker $400 Ladies Limit 7 Card Stud event.\n- Annie Duke won a World Series of Poker gold bracelet in 2004.\n- The Epic Poker League was a series of poker tournaments held in 2011 and organized by Federated Sports + Gaming.\n- Jeffrey Pollack served as Executive Chairman of the Epic Poker League.\n- Annie Duke served as Commissioner of the Epic Poker League.\n- Matt Savage served as Tournament Director of the Epic Poker League.\n- Annie Duke was formerly the leading money winner among women in World Series of Poker history, and Vanessa Selbst later held that title.\n- Michael McDonald became the youngest person to win an event on the European Poker Tour.\n- Michael McDonald also became the youngest person to win an event on the Epic Poker League.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "1841110d-002c-5548-960c-3ed39e82c409",
        "text": "Page: Epic Poker League. Sentence: The Epic Poker League was a series of poker tournaments which took place in 2011, organised by Federated Sports + Gaming.\nPage: Epic Poker League. Sentence: Former World Series of Poker commissioner Jeffrey Pollack served as Executive Chairman, professional poker player Annie Duke was Commissioner, and Matt Savage was Tournament Director.\nPage: Annie Duke. Sentence: She holds a World Series of Poker (WSOP) gold bracelet from 2004 and used to be the leading money winner among women in WSOP history (a title now held by Vanessa Selbst).\nPage: Michael McDonald (poker player). Sentence: McDonald is the youngest person to win an event on the European Poker Tour (EPT) and the youngest person to win an event on the Epic Poker League (EPL).\nPage: Barbara Freer. Sentence: Barbara Freer was a World Series of Poker champion in the 1979 $400 Ladies - Limit 7 Card Stud event.",
